description:
Celebrate the Dragon Boat Festival at Epsom Community Centre!
Enjoy a free family‑friendly day of traditional cultural workshops, creative arts and crafts, engaging activities, and plenty of delicious food stalls to explore.
Highlights include:

Zongzi making
Food stalls
Shadow puppets
Magic show and workshop
Arts and crafts
Face painting
Traditional health and wellness experiences.

Visit our website for more information about the activities.
Enjoy fun activities:

Food stalls&nbsp;
Traditional zongzi making&nbsp;
Traditional festival sachet making&nbsp;
Traditional Chinese medicine consultation&nbsp;
Magic workshop
Handmade lacquer fans workshop&nbsp;
Face painting&nbsp;
Mindfulness coffee
Tai Chi mindfulness ball&nbsp;
Dhyana tea ceremony&nbsp;
Mindful flower arrangement&nbsp;
Magic performance (11.30am to 12pm)&nbsp;
Shadow puppet experience - (12pm - 1pm &amp; 1pm - 2pm).
